      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فاهاهُ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُفَاهَاةٌ</span>; <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فاوههُ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُفَاوَهَةٌ</span>;
i. e. <i>He talked,</i> or <i>discoursed, with him:</i> and <i>he
